{
    "background_story": "Heaven was an enigmatic island shrouded in mystery. Its dense forests and winding caves were said to be riddled with ancient secrets and hidden treasures. Many adventurers had attempted to explore the island, but none had returned with tales to tell. The air was thick with an otherworldly energy, and the trees seemed to whisper cryptic messages to those who dared to listen. Legend had it that the island was cursed, and that only those with the purest of intentions could unravel its secrets. Despite the warnings, treasure hunters and cryptographers continued to flock to Heaven, hoping to decipher the cryptic clues and uncover the truth behind the island's mystique. But as they delved deeper, they realized that the island's secrets were riddled with puzzles, and that the greatest treasure of all was the truth itself.",
